Audio Duration: 2m 19.9s (139.89s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 08:06:35 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 11 | Text: 不要去共情一个不是你这个阶层的人
Segment #2   [00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,000] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 4  | Text: 有一句话说
Segment #3   [00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,120] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 你以慈悲看世界
Segment #4   [00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,800] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 这个世界都是可怜人
Segment #5   [00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,220] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 10 | Text: 但如果你要用因果去看这个世界
Segment #6   [00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:10,100] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个世界没一个是可怜人
Segment #7   [00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:12,880] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 14 | Text: 这个世界上每个人都配得上他现在的生活
Segment #8   [00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:13,660] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 4  | Text: 换句话说
Segment #9   [00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:14,580] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是他现在的生活
Segment #10  [00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:16,680] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 12 | Text: 是他过去无数次选择的结果
Segment #11  [00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:17,840] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 请记住他的认知
Segment #12  [00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:18,900] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 配得上他的苦难
Segment #13  [00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,660] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 8  | Text: 这句话听着很冷漠
Segment #14  [00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,960] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是他真的是事实
Segment #15  [00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,160] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果你把一个人带到
Segment #16  [00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,540] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 8  | Text: 原本不属于他的高度
Segment #17  [00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:26,080] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 9  | Text: 他的思想往往是跟不上
Segment #18  [00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,560] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个境界和他的阶层的
Segment #19  [00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:28,640] | Elapsed:  14.90s | Words: 5  | Text: 他的愚昧无知
Segment #20  [00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,860] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 最终会害了他自己
Segment #21  [00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,000] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 同时也把你拖压水
Segment #22  [00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,140] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 甚至会产生恶果
Segment #23  [00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:33,820] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 变成刺向你的那把刀
Segment #24  [00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:34,920] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 世间所有机遇
Segment #25  [00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:37,460] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 13 | Text: 从来不是凭空降临的溃凳或劫难
Segment #26  [00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,920] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 而是一个人认知格局
Segment #27  [00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:40,960] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 12 | Text: 与选择层层跌下的最终答案
Segment #28  [00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:43,000] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 11 | Text: 很多人总轻易对他人的困惑
Segment #29  [00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:43,760] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 心生怜悯
Segment #30  [00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:45,100] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 忍不住伸手帮扶
Segment #31  [00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,300] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 11 | Text: 枉头打破对方酒破的现状
Segment #32  [00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,080] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 11 | Text: 却忽略了一个最本质的真相
Segment #33  [00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,360] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 每个人的人生轨迹
Segment #34  [00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:52,020] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 都是由过往每一次取舍
Segment #35  [00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:52,880] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 每一次判断
Segment #36  [00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,620] | Elapsed:  33.89s | Words: 10 | Text: 每一次懈怠有坚持助救的
Segment #37  [00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:56,060] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 7  | Text: 有人深陷生活的泥潭
Segment #38  [00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:57,400] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 6  | Text: 看似命运不公
Segment #39  [00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,180] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 9  | Text: 实则是长期认知狭隘
Segment #40  [00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:01,360] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 13 | Text: 思维固化不愿改变的必然结果
Segment #41  [00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:02,500] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 5  | Text: 认知局限的人
Segment #42  [00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:04,000] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 10 | Text: 永远看不清事务的本质
Segment #43  [00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,160] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 7  | Text: 击不动顺势而为
Segment #44  [00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:06,320] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 7  | Text: 也不愿生工自我
Segment #45  [00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,860] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 9  | Text: 在该努力时贪图安逸
Segment #46  [00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:09,320] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 8  | Text: 该知损时心存侥幸
Segment #47  [00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:10,940] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 8  | Text: 该沉淀时浮躁忙从
Segment #48  [00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:12,480] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 7  | Text: 一次次错误的选择
Segment #49  [00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:14,440] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 11 | Text: 慢慢堆砌出了自己的苦难人生
Segment #50  [00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:16,120] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 8  | Text: 你以为的血中送叹
Segment #51  [00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,800] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 9  | Text: 在认知不匹配的人眼中
Segment #52  [00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:18,680] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 5  | Text: 未必是善意
Segment #53  [00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:20,400] | Elapsed:  53.19s | Words: 10 | Text: 反而可能是理所当然的愧疚
Segment #54  [00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,520] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 11 | Text: 甚至是可以肆意消耗的资源
Segment #55  [00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:24,140] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 他们无法理解你所处
Segment #56  [00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:24,980] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 结成的规则
Segment #57  [00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:25,940] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 格局与底线
Segment #58  [00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:28,180] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 11 | Text: 也存在不起突如其来的机遇
Segment #59  [00:01:28,180 --> 00:01:29,520] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 强行拉巴他人
Segment #60  [00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:30,300] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 4  | Text: 跨越阶层
Segment #61  [00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:32,260] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 11 | Text: 本质上是违背规律的徒劳
Segment #62  [00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:33,680] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 一个人的圈层与高度
Segment #63  [00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:34,760] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 从来不是外力
Segment #64  [00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,900] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 强行堆砌的疲劳
Segment #65  [00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:37,240] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 而是认知眼界
Segment #66  [00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,700] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 10 | Text: 新兴与能力的综合沉淀
Segment #67  [00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:39,940] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 当能力和思维
Segment #68  [00:01:39,940 --> 00:01:41,040] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 8  | Text: 配不上所处的位置
Segment #69  [00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:42,300] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 7  | Text: 所有的包袱与溃政
Segment #70  [00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:43,180] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 6  | Text: 都会变成隐患
Segment #71  [00:01:43,180 --> 00:01:44,960] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 9  | Text: 它会用自己的浅薄认知
Segment #72  [00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,060] | Elapsed:  72.68s | Words: 5  | Text: 看待你的善意
Segment #73  [00:01:46,060 --> 00:01:47,900] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 10 | Text: 用狭隘格局揣测你的付出
Segment #74  [00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:48,960] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 6  | Text: 一旦利益相悖
Segment #75  [00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:50,220] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 或是遭遇挫折困境
Segment #76  [00:01:50,220 --> 00:01:51,700] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 非但不会感谢你的提携
Segment #77  [00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:52,560] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 6  | Text: 反而会归咎于
Segment #78  [00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,920] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 10 | Text: 你把自身的无能与不幸
Segment #79  [00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,940] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 6  | Text: 转嫁到它身上
Segment #80  [00:01:54,940 --> 00:01:56,100] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 轻软无尺度
Segment #81  [00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:57,360] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 往往是祸断的开断
Segment #82  [00:01:57,700 --> 00:01:59,240] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 适度的善良是修养
Segment #83  [00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,560] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 过度的共情是余吃
Segment #84  [00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,500] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 12 | Text: 不必为他人的苦难过度背命
Segment #85  [00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:03,460] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 更不要强行
Segment #86  [00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:04,740] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 6  | Text: 救赎不匹配的人
Segment #87  [00:02:04,740 --> 00:02:06,920] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 9  | Text: 每个人都有自己的人生功课
Segment #88  [00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,820] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 每一份苦难
Segment #89  [00:02:07,820 --> 00:02:09,120] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 都是认知觉醒的代价
Segment #90  [00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:11,460] | Elapsed:  91.89s | Words: 13 | Text: 每一种境遇都是命运的公平回馈
Segment #91  [00:02:11,460 --> 00:02:12,740] | Elapsed: 101.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 守住自己的全层
Segment #92  [00:02:12,740 --> 00:02:13,940] | Elapsed: 101.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 克制泛滥的善意
Segment #93  [00:02:13,940 --> 00:02:15,380] | Elapsed: 101.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 尊重英国与规律
Segment #94  [00:02:15,380 --> 00:02:16,580] | Elapsed: 101.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 才是保护自己清醒
Segment #95  [00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:17,720] | Elapsed: 101.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 处事的最高智慧
Segment #96  [00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:18,080] | Elapsed: 101.22s | Words: 1  | Text: 加油
Segment #97  [00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,720] | Elapsed: 101.22s | Words: 9  | Text: 陌生人祝你们越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
